ends, artifacts to help, and loot that enhance your party\u2019s fighting prowess.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world might be lonely, but you don\u2019t have to be.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/c5e6a453f66efe6389ee6156acf98572.poster.avif?t=1766063061\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/c5e6a453f66efe6389ee6156acf98572.webm?t=1766063061\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/extras/c5e6a453f66efe6389ee6156acf98572.mp4?t=1766063061\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2>","developers":["Tiny Bull Studios"],"dlc":[3891830],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1486450/header.jpg?t=1766063061","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Developed and coproduced by Tiny Bull Studios. Coproduced by DON\u2019T NOD ENTERTAINMENT \u00a9 2025 \u2013 All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1486450/2032868947/16d6223150ab9e6b09bdb08495425345850823cb/1761139694/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761206648","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.